# Self-Hosted LLM Deployment on GCP using Terraform, GKE, and KServe

## Overview

This project deploys a self-hosted Large Language Model (LLM) on Google Cloud Platform using Terraform, Google Kubernetes Engine (GKE), KServe, and vLLM.

The deployment process is fully automated and consists of:

1. Infrastructure deployment
2. Kubernetes cluster deployment
3. KServe installation
4. Model upload and deployment
5. OpenAI-compatible API exposure

The solution has been tested with:

* TinyLlama-1.1B-Chat
* Qwen2.5-0.5B

