# Model Upload

Create a bucket:

```bash
gcloud storage buckets create gs://PROJECT_ID-models
```

Upload the model files:

```bash
gcloud storage cp -r ./model-folder gs://PROJECT_ID-models/
```

Example:

```bash
gcloud storage cp -r tinyllama gs://PROJECT_ID-models/
```

Verify upload:

```bash
gcloud storage ls gs://PROJECT_ID-models/tinyllama/
```

---

