# Common Issues

## Workload Identity Errors

Verify Kubernetes Service Account:

```bash
kubectl get sa kserve-sa -n llm -o yaml
```

Verify IAM binding:

```bash
gcloud iam service-accounts get-iam-policy SERVICE_ACCOUNT
```

---

## Model Not Found

Verify the model exists inside the bucket:

```bash
gcloud storage ls gs://PROJECT_ID-models/MODEL_NAME/
```

Ensure the storageUri exactly matches the uploaded folder name.

---

## Pod Pending

Check scheduling issues:

```bash
kubectl describe pod POD_NAME -n llm
```

Typical causes:

* Insufficient CPU
* Insufficient Memory
* GCP Quota Limits

---

## Pod OOMKilled

Increase node resources or use a smaller model.

Examples:

* TinyLlama-1.1B-Chat
* Qwen2.5-0.5B

---

